<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SECOND DAY SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SECOND DAY SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the second day of four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>In Bridgetown: Trinidad and Tobago 165 and 81-2. Barbados 238 (F.Reifer 50).</p>
<p>In Castries, St Lucia: Jamaica 77 and 12-0. Windward Islands 104. No play because of rain.</p>
<p>In Georgetown: Guyana v Leeward Islands - No play because of rain.</p>
</text>
